1
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,900
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:53,130
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

4
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:01,990
What are you waiting for?

5
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,750
Come inside.

6
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:24,520
I...

7
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,590
I... I can't quite believe it.

8
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:42,090
You figured out the missing person notice
and found this place,

9
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,520
but you don't dare to come in?

10
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,030
It's so good

11
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,190
to see you.

12
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,610
Of course you can see me.

13
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,430
We didn't say goodbye.

14
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:08,590
That Du Huangqiao

15
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:11,400
is the Cleaner for No. 76.

16
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,150
I thought he...

17
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:14,680
I wouldn't die that easily.

18
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:17,210
You're an admirable young lady.

19
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,000
What a pity.

20
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:32,360
Who saved you?

21
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,329
Leifeng Pagoda.

22
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,050
If you had come a step later,

23
00:03:59,290 --> 00:04:00,890
I wouldn't have survived.

24
00:04:58,930 --> 00:05:00,190
Who is Leifeng Pagoda?

25
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,170
Me.

26
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:17,060
You are Leifeng Pagoda?

27
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,760
Your camera's American-made, right?

28
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,500
My camera is German-made.

29
00:05:22,670 --> 00:05:24,630
I heard they have color film now.

30
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,270
Yes.

31
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:30,000
But I still prefer black and white.

32
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,040
Black is black,

33
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:32,930
and white is white.

34
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,800
You two

35
00:05:35,030 --> 00:05:35,880
are so boring.

36
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:39,350
Didn't you say that?

37
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:43,390
We can only meet with people
who know the code.

38
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,480
Smart and disciplined.

39
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,830
You passed.

40
00:05:49,770 --> 00:05:51,170
Then can I ask a question?

41
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:54,590
Did you know she was at Fairy Bath
all along?

42
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:55,830
Not exactly.

43
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:57,600
It's all thanks to you buying those

44
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,200
roasted chestnuts that day.

45
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,930
But you didn't get to talk that day.

46
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,510
You think we didn't,

47
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,800
but actually, we did.

48
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:06,720
It was all thanks to you.

49
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,060
Thanks to the scarf you wore that day.

50
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,480
The scarf was your code?

51
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,470
I told you my cousin is smart.

52
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:21,110
Five years ago in Hangzhou,

53
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,510
when Leifeng Pagoda and I first connected,

54
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:25,770
the scarf was the code.

55
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:31,150
That was why you asked me
to buy Shen Bao?

56
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:35,000
Because it had the contact info
you left for her?

57
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,000
I didn't leave it.

58
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,000
It was left by our handler,

59
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Diana.

60
00:06:39,930 --> 00:06:41,050
Who is Diana?

61
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,510
Our leader,

62
00:06:50,370 --> 00:06:53,100
and the mastermind
behind this rescue plan.

63
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,920
Without anyone noticing.

64
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,860
You guys coordinated perfectly.

65
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,950
The original plan

66
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:05,210
was to lure the people escorting me
to the fishing village,

67
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:07,590
but an accident happened along the way.

68
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:08,810
What accident?

69
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:12,630
We sent someone
to watch the entrance of Fairy Bath.

70
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,480
Cigarettes?

71
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,190
After I got off work,

72
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:15,650
I would go and relieve her.

73
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:20,010
Cigarettes?

74
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:26,750
Every few days, Fairy Bath

75
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:29,610
would send out dirty towels and sheets
to be washed.

76
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,520
I didn't pay attention at first.

77
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:33,270
One day, I saw Ding Awang

78
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:35,000
personally bring out a bundle,

79
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,659
and I became alert.

80
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:52,270
Then I noticed
that the driver delivering the towels

81
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,310
looked familiar.

82
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:58,510
At the hospital, he posed

83
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,080
as one of the pregnant woman's
family members.

84
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,440
Now he's working
as a driver for Fairy Bath.

85
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:05,070
There must be something wrong with him.

86
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,470
So I kept following them.

87
00:08:07,910 --> 00:08:08,470
Not bad.

88
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,830
Your eyes are even better

89
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,930
than mine, and I'm a photographer.

90
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,040
Impressive.

91
00:08:15,270 --> 00:08:16,510
Actually,
when he was sending the telegram,

92
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:18,570
I was already prepared to make a move.

93
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,510
I was just unsure
about Su Causeway's situation inside,

94
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:22,910
so I waited until the end.

95
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:25,030
It's all thanks to you

96
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:27,670
for taking out the agents inside.

97
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,950
Just hearing that makes me nervous.

98
00:08:33,690 --> 00:08:35,549
Accidents can happen at any time.

99
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,200
I'm used to it.

100
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,080
Those who survive a great disaster

101
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,110
will never die.

102
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,370
Everyone dies eventually.

103
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:49,540
Then let's live to be 100.

104
00:08:52,410 --> 00:08:53,200
Thank you

105
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:54,990
for saving my cousin.

106
00:08:55,820 --> 00:08:57,420
You deserve some credit too.

107
00:08:58,670 --> 00:08:59,870
Are you two showing off

108
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:01,600
because you both saved my life?

109
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:03,030
There's one more person.

110
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:03,750
Diana.

111
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,270
In that case,

112
00:09:06,590 --> 00:09:07,590
there's one more.

113
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:08,840
Who?

114
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:10,480
Me.

115
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,940
The reason I'm alive today

116
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,670
is because of

117
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,600
the Three Sights of West Lake

118
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,510
and Diana.

119
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,370
I've made up my mind.

120
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,600
I want to officially become Broken Bridge.

121
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,440
Why?

122
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:37,910
Do you remember

123
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,410
the question I asked you

124
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:42,770
that day in the church?

125
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:45,200
What is faith?

126
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,870
Probably something worth living for.

127
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:52,000
I know your faith

128
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:55,080
is in saving this country.

129
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,360
Li Musheng once told me

130
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,520
that using the camera in my hands

131
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,720
to record this era

132
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,390
is a remarkable thing.

133
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:10,180
I think I can do more,

134
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:11,630
just like him.

135
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,980
Welcome to the Three Sights of West Lake,

136
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,300
Broken Bridge.

137
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,420
Why this reaction?

138
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,030
Well...

139
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:35,530
I thought it'd take some convincing,

140
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:38,600
and then there'd be some kind of ritual
or something.

141
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:41,080
When you helped us find Ou Yang's house,

142
00:10:41,970 --> 00:10:43,830
I already applied to my superiors

143
00:10:44,220 --> 00:10:46,420
for you to become the new Broken Bridge.

144
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,670
You passed the test this time.

145
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,800
The superiors have officially approved you
to become Broken Bridge

146
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,440
and join us.

147
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,180
You thought of it long ago?

148
00:10:58,940 --> 00:11:02,000
I've known what kind of person you are
since childhood.

149
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,030
When we were kids, everyone thought

150
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:06,390
I was the naughty one.

151
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:08,080
What they didn't know was

152
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,770
that all my rebellious acts

153
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,330
were instigated by her.

154
00:11:16,450 --> 00:11:18,280
Come on! Let's take one last picture!

155
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,190
Get ready!

156
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,390
Smile.

157
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,000
Three, two, one.

158
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:22,680
Good!

159
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,880
I want to be a photographer too.

160
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:27,320
Then go.

161
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,150
Okay. Done.

162
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:35,150
What are you waiting for?

163
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:36,010
But I'm scared.

164
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,850
What's there to be afraid of?
Don't be scared.

165
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:39,630
Follow him!

166
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:42,080
-Whether it was...
-Hurry up!

167
00:11:42,390 --> 00:11:43,790
becoming a photographer

168
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,480
or joining you,

169
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:49,850
you were always the one
who showed me the way.

170
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:51,430
I'm not that important.

171
00:11:52,130 --> 00:11:54,330
These are just what your heart desires.

172
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,820
Broken Bridge.

173
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:57,600
Remember,

174
00:11:58,510 --> 00:11:59,510
from now on,

175
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:02,140
the three of us in this room are a team.

176
00:12:03,130 --> 00:12:05,130
Our handler is Diana.

177
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:06,850
Remember,

178
00:12:07,370 --> 00:12:08,700
she is our only handler.

179
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,080
Don't trust anyone else.

180
00:12:14,510 --> 00:12:15,870
Who exactly is Diana?

181
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:17,000
Am I allowed to know?

182
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:22,490
She will find you when needed.

183
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,570
Understood. I know the rules.

184
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:27,040
Can I ask one more question?

185
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:28,870
Well... why...

186
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:31,560
why are you called
the Three Sights of West Lake?

187
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:38,090
The three of us
worked together in Hangzhou.

188
00:12:38,510 --> 00:12:40,910
Broken Bridge
used to hide intelligence in photos

189
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:42,510
and leave it by the West Lake.

190
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,290
That was how we exchanged intelligence.

191
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,320
But...

192
00:12:47,870 --> 00:12:49,510
none of us have ever seen Broken Bridge.

193
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,400
I always thought we would meet.

194
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,270
I also wondered

195
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,240
what the Three Sights of West Lake
gathering

196
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,960
would be like.

197
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,260
I thought it would be by the West Lake,

198
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,840
under the sunset.

199
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:09,650
I didn't expect it to be like this,

200
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,320
in a rundown house.

201
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,120
But none of that matters.

202
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,320
As long as we are still alive,

203
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:25,430
there is hope to keep going.

204
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,920
To the Three Sights of West Lake.

205
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,220
To Broken Bridge never breaking.

206
00:13:49,030 --> 00:13:49,670
Master.

207
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,200
To you.

208
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:19,960
Do you remember when the last time

209
00:14:20,910 --> 00:14:22,770
we went on a mission together was?

210
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,420
I haven't really counted.

211
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:30,510
Five years, three months,

212
00:14:32,630 --> 00:14:33,490
and seven days.

213
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,930
I hope I remembered correctly.

214
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,790
Having died so many times

215
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,640
and become like this now,

216
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:52,880
I'm really worried I might become stupid.

217
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,560
You haven't changed at all.

218
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:56,410
Still as smart as ever.

219
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:04,070
What are Diana's instructions?

220
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:10,000
Ou Yang is the key
to unraveling Project Slumber.

221
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,720
We must find this person.

222
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,230
I got some clues from Sachiko.

223
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:19,750
Her family has some influence in Japan,

224
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:21,880
so the Japanese won't kill her easily.

225
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:24,510
This person should still be in Shanghai.

226
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:28,120
If she is in the hands of the Japanese,

227
00:15:28,510 --> 00:15:30,770
it will be hard for us to infiltrate them.

228
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,200
Among us,

229
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:38,390
Broken Bridge has the best chance
of getting close to the Japanese.

230
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:40,560
Focus on recovering first.

231
00:15:41,390 --> 00:15:42,190
In the future,

232
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:45,020
there will be more important missions.

233
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:56,310
I'll leave you some money for emergencies.

234
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,490
The photo in your wallet...

235
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:04,900
Do you still have it?

236
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:13,550
How could Mr. Zhao keep

237
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:15,480
a photo from the past in his wallet?

238
00:16:20,070 --> 00:16:20,800
I'm leaving.

239
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,800
Be careful.

240
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,520
Focus on recovering.

241
00:16:48,580 --> 00:16:50,770
♪ Give me a kiss ♪

242
00:16:50,790 --> 00:16:53,070
♪ Will you? ♪

243
00:16:53,650 --> 00:16:55,970
♪ A flying kiss would do just as well ♪

244
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:58,220
♪ I'd still be grateful ♪

245
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:01,190
♪ Give me a kiss ♪

246
00:17:01,210 --> 00:17:03,430
♪ It's okay if you don't ♪

247
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:06,170
♪ A flying kiss can still be sweet ♪

248
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,609
♪ I'd still be grateful ♪

249
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,109
Go away!

250
00:17:08,910 --> 00:17:10,910
♪ I'd still be grateful ♪

251
00:17:11,230 --> 00:17:13,700
♪ I'd still be grateful ♪

252
00:17:18,210 --> 00:17:19,859
None of you men are any good.

253
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,060
I don't know if others are good or not,

254
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,310
but I am.

255
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,640
That's not entirely true.

256
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,960
Have a drink with me,

257
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,940
and I may buy a few more tickets
to dance with you.

258
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,980
Sorry, sorry.

259
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,510
Du, I'm warning you.

260
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:03,930
Stay away from Chen Kailai.

261
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:05,990
He is not Yang Xiaoxian.

262
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,510
If you won't let me get close
to Chen Kailai,

263
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:10,910
will you keep me company?

264
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:13,680
Sorry, sorry.

265
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:14,310
She's drunk.

266
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:15,910
I'll take her away right now.

267
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:16,920
Move!

268
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,680
Don't bow to him!

269
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,070
Stand up straight!

270
00:18:20,810 --> 00:18:21,370
Useless!

271
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:22,450
Woman,

272
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,810
you really don't know what's good for you.

273
00:18:29,550 --> 00:18:31,480
For the sake of your past relationship,
my brother

274
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,780
doesn't want to argue with you,

275
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:34,640
and you're now pushing your luck?

276
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:36,350
Past relationship?

277
00:18:38,470 --> 00:18:40,530
What relationship do I have with you?

278
00:18:51,030 --> 00:18:52,070
That's right.

279
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,270
Since we have no relationship,

280
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:55,070
take her away.

281
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:57,310
No. 76 has plenty of rooms.

282
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:04,070
Captain Du!

283
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:08,240
Please be the bigger person.

284
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:10,030
Jinbao doesn't know any better.

285
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:11,030
How about this?

286
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:14,030
I'll cover all your expenses
at the dance hall

287
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:14,960
this month.

288
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,070
How much money does your family have left

289
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:24,070
that hasn't been squandered by you?

290
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,440
Spending all your money on women

291
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,960
is not worth it.

292
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:30,030
Later, I'll bring a gift

293
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:31,950
and apologize to you in person.

294
00:19:31,950 --> 00:19:33,400
Instead of spending time on women,

295
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:35,880
you should focus
on your family's business.

296
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,750
I heard your old man

297
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:39,410
has dealings with Chongqing.

298
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:40,850
That's purely a rumor!

299
00:19:42,430 --> 00:19:43,960
Consider yourself warned!

300
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,200
Mr. Chen, Mr. Chen!

301
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,510
Open the door, Mr. Chen!

302
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,080
You knew I would come?

303
00:20:44,430 --> 00:20:46,160
I've been in the car since early morning

304
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:48,490
just so you wouldn't have
to wait too long.

305
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,070
Let her go.

306
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,130
Eat something with me.

307
00:20:58,130 --> 00:20:59,530
We'll talk after eating.

308
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:01,980
Du,

309
00:21:02,830 --> 00:21:03,830
you deliberately provoked her

310
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:05,110
just to make me beg you?

311
00:21:05,790 --> 00:21:07,190
You really have no shame.

312
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:12,720
If I weren't a little shameless,

313
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:15,590
would you be sitting here
and listening to me obediently?

314
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:16,640
What exactly do you want?

315
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,970
I want you to work for me.

316
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,200
Like I said,

317
00:21:21,870 --> 00:21:24,470
following the right person
is very important.

318
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:27,080
Then who are you following?

319
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:31,450
Chairman Wang.

320
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:34,000
And that Li Moqun.

321
00:21:35,550 --> 00:21:38,350
How do you know
you're following the right people?

322
00:21:41,360 --> 00:21:42,220
Let me tell you,

323
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:45,790
no one in this world is always right.

324
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,350
I only know

325
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:49,920
they're right for now.

326
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:51,310
It's the same for you.

327
00:21:52,110 --> 00:21:52,960
Right now,

328
00:21:53,330 --> 00:21:55,530
I'm the only person who's right for you.

329
00:21:56,050 --> 00:21:57,920
At least I'm the only one who can decide

330
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,120
whether to let her go.

331
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:02,920
Are you still the Battalion Commander Du

332
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,320
I saw on the battlefield?

333
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:05,680
No.

334
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,330
Why?

335
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:13,320
Because I found out
their so-called faith...

336
00:22:15,530 --> 00:22:16,490
is all bullshit.

337
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:19,730
The Japanese Army has broken through
the outer defense line of Nanjing.

338
00:22:19,730 --> 00:22:20,530
Pass my order!

339
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:22,900
Everyone must arrive at Dawukesong

340
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:24,340
by 12:00 PM tomorrow

341
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:25,790
to intercept the enemy!

342
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:26,480
Yes!

343
00:22:26,520 --> 00:22:28,120
Make your own preparations!

344
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:34,580
Anything else?

345
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,880
Division Commander.

346
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,050
I am loyal to the Party-State,

347
00:22:39,050 --> 00:22:40,580
and I am not afraid of death!

348
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:43,480
It's just that my wife and daughter

349
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,680
are still in Nanjing.

350
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:52,830
Hurry up

351
00:22:52,830 --> 00:22:53,830
and go to see them.

352
00:22:54,030 --> 00:22:54,790
I'll find a way

353
00:22:54,790 --> 00:22:57,720
to have someone send them
to the countryside to hide.

354
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:01,720
Someone from the division headquarters
will come to pick you up.

355
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:03,850
Go hide in the countryside for a while.

356
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:05,180
What about you?

357
00:23:06,310 --> 00:23:07,070
Dad.

358
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:10,270
I want to go with you.

359
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:14,980
You guys, come here!

360
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:16,070
Come here now!

361
00:23:21,350 --> 00:23:23,640
Stop dawdling! Hurry up!

362
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,920
Shut up, you!

363
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:30,680
Hurry up!

364
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:31,770
Hurry up!

365
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:33,720
Be quiet!

366
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:03,800
When I found the bodies
of my wife and daughter,

367
00:24:06,780 --> 00:24:09,170
I felt that everything was meaningless.

368
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:13,680
They lied to me,

369
00:24:15,350 --> 00:24:17,810
saying they had put my family
in a safe place.

370
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:20,200
Liars.

371
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,220
They are all liars.

372
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:27,680
But it was the Japanese who killed them.

373
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:33,510
Who let the Japanese in?

374
00:24:35,180 --> 00:24:38,070
And who abandoned city after city?

375
00:24:38,090 --> 00:24:38,930
Who?

376
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:43,110
Just to stay alive,

377
00:24:44,270 --> 00:24:46,800
do you have to have so much blood
on your hands?

378
00:24:49,490 --> 00:24:53,090
Are you still holding a grudge against me
because of your cousin?

379
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:58,370
If I told you she's still alive,

380
00:24:58,510 --> 00:24:59,710
would you believe it?

381
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:03,480
I'd be damned if I believed you.

382
00:25:04,430 --> 00:25:06,000
If she had died in my hands,

383
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:08,440
I would be more than just a captain now.

384
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,440
Then where is she?

385
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:13,190
She probably went to Yan'an.

386
00:25:15,210 --> 00:25:16,240
I can only believe

387
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:17,600
half of what you say now.

388
00:25:18,550 --> 00:25:19,810
If she really is alive,

389
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:21,970
then at least Heaven isn't blind.

390
00:25:23,030 --> 00:25:24,710
Heaven isn't blind?

391
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:27,310
It was me, a blind man,

392
00:25:27,310 --> 00:25:29,200
turning a blind eye.

393
00:25:31,750 --> 00:25:32,680
You let her go?

394
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,020
I don't believe it.

395
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:37,240
You don't have that kind of conscience.

396
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,300
You're the one without a conscience.

397
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,350
If I wanted to kill her,

398
00:25:42,590 --> 00:25:43,920
would I have let her out?

399
00:25:52,230 --> 00:25:53,830
Come to No. 76 and work for me.

400
00:25:54,760 --> 00:25:57,420
There's a position here
that's perfect for you.

401
00:25:58,020 --> 00:25:59,880
Du Huangqiao trusts you a lot now.

402
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:02,520
He wants me to go to No. 76 with him.

403
00:26:02,990 --> 00:26:03,800
I refused.

404
00:26:07,650 --> 00:26:09,710
Diana wants you to agree to his offer.

405
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:13,160
Du Huangqiao is now
Li Moqun's right-hand man.

406
00:26:13,870 --> 00:26:16,380
You need to stay by his side
and act as an informant.

407
00:26:16,380 --> 00:26:17,910
If you bring it up yourself,

408
00:26:17,980 --> 00:26:19,910
they will definitely suspect you.

409
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,460
Wait for him to make a move,

410
00:26:21,890 --> 00:26:23,240
and then respond accordingly.

411
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,640
I'm just a photographer.

412
00:26:24,700 --> 00:26:26,830
How can I help you at No. 76?

413
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:31,340
Just use the camera in your hands
to record history.

414
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:35,210
If it's just taking pictures,

415
00:26:35,750 --> 00:26:37,750
there's no need for me to go to No. 76.

416
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:40,200
What's the point
of being branded a traitor

417
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:41,110
for no reason?

418
00:26:41,790 --> 00:26:44,050
Of course it's not just taking pictures.

419
00:26:45,160 --> 00:26:46,160
Like I said,

420
00:26:46,510 --> 00:26:49,110
following the right person
is very important.

421
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,570
If you come to No. 76,

422
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:53,750
I'll arrange for you
to go to the Propaganda Section.

423
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:56,550
Within a year,
you will be the section chief there.

424
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,860
Release Jinbao immediately.

425
00:27:10,590 --> 00:27:12,120
That's the right attitude.

426
00:27:38,790 --> 00:27:40,120
You agreed to his offer?

427
00:27:43,160 --> 00:27:45,030
Have you forgotten
who killed Yang Xiaoxian

428
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:46,200
and your cousin?

429
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:54,030
They are all dead,

430
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:58,250
but you are still alive.

431
00:28:04,510 --> 00:28:05,770
Did you do it to save me?

432
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:21,960
I want both of us...

433
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:25,160
to survive.

434
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:29,830
I'm tired.

435
00:28:31,370 --> 00:28:32,200
Let's go back.

436
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:38,600
I had no choice.

437
00:29:05,350 --> 00:29:07,610
Take some more photos of me in the future.

438
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:15,750
Alright.

439
00:29:18,490 --> 00:29:20,350
I don't want to end up like Auntie,

440
00:29:21,270 --> 00:29:22,490
with nothing but a portrait

441
00:29:22,490 --> 00:29:24,290
on my gravestone after I'm gone.

442
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,240
When I die,

443
00:29:28,270 --> 00:29:30,470
make sure they put my best picture on it.

444
00:29:31,810 --> 00:29:33,540
How about the one of me dancing?

445
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:36,250
I'm the queen of the dance hall,
after all.

446
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:38,260
Stop saying such unlucky things.

447
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:41,810
Have you ever taken a photo of me dancing?

448
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:44,600
I'll take one when I'm free.

449
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:45,750
Let's do it today.

450
00:29:46,310 --> 00:29:48,170
There is no time like the present.

451
00:29:49,020 --> 00:29:50,550
The Communists have Diana.

452
00:29:51,630 --> 00:29:53,290
The NBIS has the God of Wealth.

453
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:55,960
Fortunately,

454
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:57,590
I have you.

455
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:01,110
Director.

456
00:30:02,510 --> 00:30:03,350
I will help you

457
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,680
root them out one by one.

458
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:09,680
By the way,

459
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:13,640
Mr. Feng
from the match factory's collusion

460
00:30:14,110 --> 00:30:16,110
with the NBIS has also come to light.

461
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:18,490
You got it done so quickly?

462
00:30:20,100 --> 00:30:21,340
It was nothing.

463
00:30:22,830 --> 00:30:25,630
Ding Awang is already on his way there
with his men.

464
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:26,750
Good.

465
00:30:38,030 --> 00:30:39,800
[Feng's]

466
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:45,750
Thank you.

467
00:30:47,030 --> 00:30:48,900
Inspector, the latest report
from the Chamber of Commerce.

468
00:30:48,900 --> 00:30:49,880
Master Feng was accused of

469
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,410
colluding with Chongqing.

470
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:52,510
His factory was closed down.

471
00:30:52,510 --> 00:30:54,510
He spent a fortune to get out of jail.

472
00:30:54,790 --> 00:30:57,110
It's only been a few days, and they
already can't hold themselves back.

473
00:30:57,110 --> 00:31:00,200
They actually came up with the idea
of catching spies to make money.

474
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,660
Du Huangqiao's men did it?

475
00:31:02,150 --> 00:31:02,740
Yes.

476
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,440
Yu Yingxiang died,

477
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:07,040
and here comes Du Huangqiao.

478
00:31:08,270 --> 00:31:10,670
The whole system is rotten.
It doesn't matter who's in that position.

479
00:31:10,670 --> 00:31:12,330
Let them keep making trouble.

480
00:31:12,350 --> 00:31:14,370
When they ruin the reputation
of the Nanjing government,

481
00:31:14,370 --> 00:31:15,440
they will behave.

482
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:19,480
It's just a pity
for those patriotic businessmen.

483
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:22,440
Let's protect them as much as we can.

484
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,690
Any movement from Hoshino?

485
00:31:27,950 --> 00:31:29,370
His daughter's birthday is coming up,

486
00:31:29,370 --> 00:31:30,970
and he sent us an invitation.

487
00:31:31,570 --> 00:31:35,740
[Invitation]

488
00:31:34,110 --> 00:31:35,350
Perfect timing.

489
00:31:45,060 --> 00:31:45,860
Open the door.

490
00:31:51,830 --> 00:31:53,480
Your office is ready.

491
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,440
Captain Du...

492
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:58,200
Captain Du sent me to pick you up.

493
00:32:13,270 --> 00:32:14,480
Treating you like that back then

494
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:15,880
was out of necessity.

495
00:32:15,900 --> 00:32:17,810
I actually held back on you.

496
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:19,720
I'm much harsher on others.

497
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,840
Shasha is your lover, right?

498
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:26,440
Yes, yes.

499
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:27,360
What's wrong?

500
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,830
Last time she took 5,000 yuan from us,

501
00:32:29,830 --> 00:32:30,920
and she said she gave it to you.

502
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,980
Did you receive it?

503
00:32:32,430 --> 00:32:33,750
Yes, I remember it.

504
00:32:33,860 --> 00:32:35,460
But that doesn't seem right.

505
00:32:36,490 --> 00:32:37,220
It was 4,000.

506
00:32:37,750 --> 00:32:38,510
4,000?

507
00:32:39,070 --> 00:32:39,880
Let me ask Brother Du.

508
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:40,510
No need.

509
00:32:40,870 --> 00:32:41,590
5,000.

510
00:32:42,270 --> 00:32:43,110
It was 5,000.

511
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:46,070
This is 5,000.

512
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:47,280
Make it quick.

513
00:32:47,310 --> 00:32:48,110
Definitely.

514
00:33:10,730 --> 00:33:11,860
Mr. Du, you're here.

515
00:33:32,810 --> 00:33:34,780
Mr. Du, what do you think of this?

516
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:55,280
This bucket is too old.
It needs to be replaced.

517
00:34:58,880 --> 00:34:59,620
Your family...

518
00:34:59,620 --> 00:35:00,880
None of your business.

519
00:35:01,150 --> 00:35:02,030
From now on, you'd better

520
00:35:02,030 --> 00:35:04,230
go to Jinbao's room less often at night.

521
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:09,770
What are you talking about with my Kailai?

522
00:35:12,790 --> 00:35:14,020
I am yours.

523
00:35:14,580 --> 00:35:16,910
Chen is only living with you temporarily.

524
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:20,810
Stop waving those flowers in front of me.

525
00:35:21,190 --> 00:35:22,520
I am allergic to pollen.

526
00:35:23,170 --> 00:35:24,770
Lilies have the most pollen.

527
00:35:25,330 --> 00:35:27,530
You weren't allergic before, were you?

528
00:35:28,030 --> 00:35:29,440
Can't I be allergic now?

529
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:31,630
That's easy.

530
00:35:33,110 --> 00:35:34,150
If we remove the stamens,

531
00:35:34,150 --> 00:35:35,350
they can live longer.

532
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:38,410
You actually believe that?

533
00:35:39,530 --> 00:35:40,860
I won't disturb you two.

534
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,090
Where are you going?

535
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:48,560
It was because of your foolishness

536
00:35:48,560 --> 00:35:50,960
that your family's factory was taken away.

537
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,710
Let's leave Shanghai.

538
00:36:01,510 --> 00:36:03,190
Shanghai is too chaotic right now.

539
00:36:03,190 --> 00:36:05,120
It's very hard to do business here.

540
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:08,400
Where can we go if we leave Shanghai?

541
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:09,880
Anywhere is fine.

542
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:13,550
Major.

543
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:17,880
Let's dance first, then have a drink.

544
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,320
Okay.

545
00:36:35,290 --> 00:36:37,290
Done. There's no pollen left at all.

546
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:40,540
Let me tell you,

547
00:36:41,190 --> 00:36:42,670
when a pollen allergy is severe,

548
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:44,130
a person can go into shock.

549
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:46,080
When a woman goes into shock,

550
00:36:46,100 --> 00:36:47,960
she's like a sow that's been shot.

551
00:36:48,070 --> 00:36:49,470
She'll foam at the mouth.

552
00:37:05,990 --> 00:37:06,760
Run!

553
00:37:06,780 --> 00:37:08,380
Why aren't you afraid at all?

554
00:37:10,980 --> 00:37:11,630
Jinbao!

555
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,110
Jinbao!

556
00:37:27,830 --> 00:37:28,500
Jinbao!

557
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:30,110
Jinbao!

558
00:37:31,070 --> 00:37:31,920
Jinbao!

559
00:37:37,070 --> 00:37:38,440
Miss Sachiko, let's go!

560
00:37:38,910 --> 00:37:39,660
Hurry!

561
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:44,190
Major!

562
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:14,550
The institute address you gave me
was fake.

563
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:17,670
It was to lure the people of Branch 12

564
00:38:17,670 --> 00:38:19,070
to gather at Fairy Bath,

565
00:38:19,240 --> 00:38:21,770
so Du the Blind
could wipe them all out at once.

566
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:27,110
That blind man forced me to do it.

567
00:38:27,580 --> 00:38:30,060
He found out about my relationship
with Captain Tao.

568
00:38:30,060 --> 00:38:31,120
If I didn't do it...

569
00:38:31,670 --> 00:38:33,530
If I didn't do it, he would kill me.

570
00:38:48,210 --> 00:38:49,560
Twelve soldiers

571
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:52,360
died because of you.

572
00:38:54,370 --> 00:38:56,400
Do you think you can still live?

573
00:38:58,020 --> 00:38:59,110
Give me a chance.

574
00:38:59,660 --> 00:39:01,020
I can make up for it.

575
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:08,960
Tell me the real address of the institute.

576
00:39:09,880 --> 00:39:10,480
I...

577
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,510
I really don't know!

578
00:39:23,150 --> 00:39:24,760
You have to earn your chance.

579
00:39:25,110 --> 00:39:26,670
Please, let me go.

580
00:39:27,190 --> 00:39:28,990
I'll tell you everything I know.

581
00:39:29,070 --> 00:39:30,280
I know a lot of things.

582
00:39:32,110 --> 00:39:34,370
I'm only interested in Project Slumber.

583
00:39:35,070 --> 00:39:36,070
Project Slumber?

584
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:37,410
Project Slumber...

585
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:38,880
I know someone.

586
00:39:39,920 --> 00:39:40,680
Ou Yang,

587
00:39:41,070 --> 00:39:42,670
Hoshino's former assistant.

588
00:39:42,670 --> 00:39:43,930
A woman from Shanghai.

589
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,850
She was in Project Slumber before.

590
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:48,190
She was suspected of being a Communist

591
00:39:48,190 --> 00:39:49,550
and was arrested
by the Plum Blossom Agency.

592
00:39:49,550 --> 00:39:50,810
Where is she locked up?

593
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:56,150
Well...

594
00:39:56,480 --> 00:39:57,810
I don't know about this,

595
00:39:58,510 --> 00:39:59,910
but I can find out for you.

596
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:01,160
I can find out for you.

597
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,800
This bow...

598
00:40:06,910 --> 00:40:09,060
is for the 12 soldiers.

599
00:40:12,420 --> 00:40:13,310
This bow...

600
00:40:15,100 --> 00:40:16,420
is for Yang Xiaoxian.

601
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:19,840
Don't kill me.

602
00:40:20,070 --> 00:40:21,360
Please, don't kill me.

603
00:40:31,580 --> 00:40:32,620
Don't kill you?

604
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:45,950
Such a pretty face.

605
00:40:47,840 --> 00:40:48,880
What a pity.

606
00:41:09,290 --> 00:41:10,850
Whether you did it for money

607
00:41:12,230 --> 00:41:13,390
or for a man,

608
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:17,320
traitors must die.

609
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:23,230
I didn't expect

610
00:41:25,230 --> 00:41:26,690
you to be the God of Wealth.

611
00:41:31,180 --> 00:41:32,110
Got a cigarette?
